{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:07:53.929Z","type":"file-open","payload":{"uri":"file:///c%3A/Users/ds3/Vaishnavidixit6/README.md","initialContent":"<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/header.svg\" width=\"100%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## About Me\r\n\r\nHi! I'm **Vaishnavi Dixit**, a Data Science graduate student passionate about building AI-driven solutions that make a real-world impact.\r\n\r\nMy interests include:\r\n\r\n- Healthcare AI\r\n- Machine Learning\r\n- Statistical Modeling\r\n- Large Language Models\r\n- Responsible AI\r\n\r\nCurrently exploring research in healthcare, uncertainty quantification, and intelligent systems.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## Projects\r\n\r\n### Hospital Readmission Risk Prediction\r\nMachine learning system built using **MIMIC-IV**, **FastAPI**, **React**, and **Google BigQuery** to identify patients at high risk of readmission.\r\n\r\n### Healthcare Abuse Detection\r\nDeveloped a machine learning model to identify likely unreported abuse cases using Social Determinants of Health (SDOH) survey data.\r\n\r\n### Jewelry E-Commerce Website\r\nFull-stack e-commerce platform with authentication, product catalog, shopping cart, and responsive user experience.\r\n\r\n### Road Infrastructure Analysis *(In Progress)*\r\nBuilding a data-driven solution for road infrastructure analysis using machine learning and geospatial techniques.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## 🛠 Tech Stack\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=python,r,react,fastapi,postgres,docker,aws,git,pytorch,tensorflow,mysql,vscode&perline=6\"/>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## Research Interests\r\n\r\n- Healthcare AI\r\n- Biomedical Machine Learning\r\n- Responsible AI\r\n- Uncertainty Quantification\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## GitHub Stats\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img height=\"165\" src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username=VaishnaviDixit&show_icons=true&theme=dark&hide_border=true&bg_color=0B1026&title_color=D4AF37&icon_color=F8E28A&text_color=dddad8\"/>\r\n  <img height=\"165\" src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/top-langs/?username=VaishnaviDixit&layout=compact&theme=dark&hide_border=true&bg_color=0B1026&title_color=D4AF37&text_color=dddad8\"/>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## Contributions\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VaishnaviDixit/VaishnaviDixit/output/github-contribution-grid-snake-dark.svg\"/>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## Contact\r\n\r\n- 🔗 LinkedIn\r\n- 📧 Email\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>"}}
{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:07:53.944Z","type":"file-open","payload":{"uri":"file:///c%3A/Users/ds3/Vaishnavidixit6/README.md","initialContent":"<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/header.svg\" width=\"100%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## About Me\r\n\r\nHi! I'm **Vaishnavi Dixit**, a Data Science graduate student passionate about building AI-driven solutions that make a real-world impact.\r\n\r\nMy interests include:\r\n\r\n- Healthcare AI\r\n- Machine Learning\r\n- Statistical Modeling\r\n- Large Language Models\r\n- Responsible AI\r\n\r\nCurrently exploring research in healthcare, uncertainty quantification, and intelligent systems.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## Projects\r\n\r\n### Hospital Readmission Risk Prediction\r\nMachine learning system built using **MIMIC-IV**, **FastAPI**, **React**, and **Google BigQuery** to identify patients at high risk of readmission.\r\n\r\n### Healthcare Abuse Detection\r\nDeveloped a machine learning model to identify likely unreported abuse cases using Social Determinants of Health (SDOH) survey data.\r\n\r\n### Jewelry E-Commerce Website\r\nFull-stack e-commerce platform with authentication, product catalog, shopping cart, and responsive user experience.\r\n\r\n### Road Infrastructure Analysis *(In Progress)*\r\nBuilding a data-driven solution for road infrastructure analysis using machine learning and geospatial techniques.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## 🛠 Tech Stack\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=python,r,react,fastapi,postgres,docker,aws,git,pytorch,tensorflow,mysql,vscode&perline=6\"/>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## Research Interests\r\n\r\n- Healthcare AI\r\n- Biomedical Machine Learning\r\n- Responsible AI\r\n- Uncertainty Quantification\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## GitHub Stats\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img height=\"165\" src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username=VaishnaviDixit&show_icons=true&theme=dark&hide_border=true&bg_color=0B1026&title_color=D4AF37&icon_color=F8E28A&text_color=dddad8\"/>\r\n  <img height=\"165\" src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/top-langs/?username=VaishnaviDixit&layout=compact&theme=dark&hide_border=true&bg_color=0B1026&title_color=D4AF37&text_color=dddad8\"/>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## Contributions\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VaishnaviDixit/VaishnaviDixit/output/github-contribution-grid-snake-dark.svg\"/>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n## Contact\r\n\r\n- 🔗 LinkedIn\r\n- 📧 Email\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\r\n</p>"}}
