{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:27:47.759Z","type":"file-open","payload":{"uri":"file:///c%3A/Users/ds3/Vaishnavidixit6/README.md","initialContent":"<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/header.svg\" width=\"100%\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## About Me\n\nI'm **Vaishnavi Dixit**, a Data Science graduate student building practical, responsible AI solutions for real-world problems.\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## Projects\n\n### Hospital Readmission Risk Prediction\nMachine learning system using **MIMIC-IV, Python, FastAPI, React,** and **Google BigQuery** to identify patients at high risk of readmission.\n\n### Healthcare Abuse Detection\nMachine learning model using **Python** and **SDOH survey data** to identify likely unreported abuse cases.\n\n### Jewelry E-Commerce Website\nFull-stack e-commerce platform built with **React, FastAPI, PostgreSQL,** and **Docker**. Used a vibe-engineering workflow to rapidly prototype and refine the user experience.\n\n### Road Infrastructure Analysis *(In Progress)*\nBuilding a **Python**-based machine learning and geospatial analysis solution for road infrastructure.\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## Research Interests\n\n- Healthcare AI\n- Biomedical Machine Learning\n- Responsible AI\n- Uncertainty Quantification\n- Statistical Modeling\n- Large Language Models\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## GitHub Stats\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img height=\"165\" src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username=Vaishnavidixit6&show_icons=true&theme=dark&hide_border=true&bg_color=0B1026&title_color=D4AF37&icon_color=F8E28A&text_color=dddad8\"/>\n  <img height=\"165\" src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/top-langs/?username=Vaishnavidixit6&layout=compact&theme=dark&hide_border=true&bg_color=0B1026&title_color=D4AF37&text_color=dddad8\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## Contributions\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vaishnavidixit6/Vaishnavidixit6/output/github-contribution-grid-snake-dark.svg\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## Contact\n\n- LinkedIn\n- Email\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n"}}
{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:27:47.769Z","type":"file-open","payload":{"uri":"file:///c%3A/Users/ds3/Vaishnavidixit6/README.md","initialContent":"<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/header.svg\" width=\"100%\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## About Me\n\nI'm **Vaishnavi Dixit**, a Data Science graduate student building practical, responsible AI solutions for real-world problems.\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## Projects\n\n### Hospital Readmission Risk Prediction\nMachine learning system using **MIMIC-IV, Python, FastAPI, React,** and **Google BigQuery** to identify patients at high risk of readmission.\n\n### Healthcare Abuse Detection\nMachine learning model using **Python** and **SDOH survey data** to identify likely unreported abuse cases.\n\n### Jewelry E-Commerce Website\nFull-stack e-commerce platform built with **React, FastAPI, PostgreSQL,** and **Docker**. Used a vibe-engineering workflow to rapidly prototype and refine the user experience.\n\n### Road Infrastructure Analysis *(In Progress)*\nBuilding a **Python**-based machine learning and geospatial analysis solution for road infrastructure.\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## Research Interests\n\n- Healthcare AI\n- Biomedical Machine Learning\n- Responsible AI\n- Uncertainty Quantification\n- Statistical Modeling\n- Large Language Models\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/divider.svg\" width=\"60%\">\n</p>\n\n## GitHub Stats\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img height=\"165\" src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username=Vaishnavidixit6&show_icons=true&theme=dark&hide_border=true&bg_color=0B1026&title_color=D4AF37&icon_color=F8E28A&text_color=dddad8\"/>\n  <img height=\"165\" src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/top-langs/?username=Vaishnavidixit6&layout=compact&theme=dark&hide_border=true&bg_color=0B1026&title_colo